Asset notice / 素材声明

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project only
(index.js, client.js, scan.js, scripts/, test/, docs). It does NOT cover the
sticker images under assets/.

The sticker images originate from the "Aha" (阿哈) sticker pack shared by the
Bilibili creator 「最上川下山」. Copyright in the artwork (characters, frames,
animations) belongs to the original creator and rights holders. This
repository claims no ownership of, and grants no license to, those images;
they are bundled solely for personal, non-commercial use by the repository
author. Do not use them commercially, redistribute them separately, or
present them as your own; if you want to reuse them, contact the original
creator for permission and keep the attribution.

If you are the creator or a rights holder and would like the assets removed,
please open an issue. Upon verification the assets/ directory will be deleted
and the plugin will default to a user-supplied sticker folder (configure `dir`).

内置表情包原始素材来自哔哩哔哩 UP 主「最上川下山」，版权归原作者及原权利方所有；
本仓库仅为个人非商业使用而收录，不主张权利、不授予任何素材许可。
如你是权利方并希望移除，请开 Issue，确认后会立即删除 assets/ 目录并改为用户自备素材目录。
